# The Angular panel is built in graspcraft_frontend and its output is copied in
# here, so everything under public/ is generated - hashed bundles, prerendered
# routes, assets, licences. Only Laravel's own four files belong in the repo.
#
# Consequence to remember when deploying: pulling this branch no longer brings a
# built panel with it. The server has to run the frontend build and copy its
# dist/ into public/, or the copy has to be shipped some other way.
#
# Anything listed separately before (build/, hot, storage, the fonts manifest)
# is covered by the blanket rule now.
/public/*
!/public/.htaccess
!/public/index.php
!/public/robots.txt
!/public/favicon.ico
